---
import {Icon} from 'astro-icon/components';
import { Button, Container, TextCardSection } from '../../components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
	title: 'Understand SocialScape',
	description: 'Learn More about SocialScape'
};
---

<Layout {seo}>
	<Container>
		<TextCardSection>
			<h1>Work With SocialScape, Get Results</h1>
			<p>
				SocialScape specializes in assisting cybersecurity firms in acquiring high-value clients through targeted outbound outreach. 
				We focus on regulated industries such as banking, healthcare, and gaming, where robust security and compliance are paramount.
			</p>
			<p>
				Our approach includes crafting highly personalized outreach campaigns to connect your firm with key decision-makers. 
				We help you develop a compelling offer that addresses your target clients' specific cybersecurity needs, positioning your firm as the optimal solution. 
				By implementing a proven outreach model via LinkedIn and email, we aim to schedule over 20 qualified meetings monthly, leading to new high-value clients within 90 days, guaranteed.
			</p>
			<p>
				Partnering with SocialScape can lead to increased revenue, predictable cash flow, and a streamlined outreach strategy, 
				allowing your team to concentrate on delivering exceptional cybersecurity services.
			</p>
			<p>
				To learn more about how SocialScape can help your cybersecurity firm secure high-value clients, please visit our website or contact us directly.
			</p>
			
			<h2>Contact Information:</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Email: <a href="mailto:Contact@trysocialscape.co.uk">Contact Us</a></li>
				<li>Phone (UK): +44 7407 042 644</li>
				<li>Phone (US): +1 480 952 6946</li>
			</ul>
			
			<h2>Registered Office:</h2>
			<address>
				Unit 3D North Point House,<br />
				North Point Business Park,<br />
				New Mallow Road, Cork<br />
				T23 AT2P<br />
				Ireland
			</address>
			
			<div class="cta-buttons__container">
				<Button
					href="/company/contact"
					outlined
					newTab
					customIcon
				>
Get in  contact today			<Fragment slot="icon">
						<Icon name="ic:baseline-launch" />
					</Fragment>
				</Button>
				<Button
					href="/theme/theme-setup"
					customIcon
				>
					Theme Setup
					<Fragment slot="icon">
						<Icon name="ic:baseline-chevron-right" />
					</Fragment>
				</Button>
				<Button
					href="/theme/customizing-odyssey"
					customIcon
				>
					Customizing Odyssey
					<Fragment slot="icon">
						<Icon name="ic:baseline-chevron-right" />
					</Fragment>
				</Button>
			</div>
		</TextCardSection>
	</Container>
</Layout>

<style>
	.cta-buttons__container {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.cta-buttons__container :global(a) {
		margin-right: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}